1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,753
Every company knows more

2
00:00:01,753 --> 00:00:03,440
than any one person can find.

3
00:00:03,709 --> 00:00:04,919
Know-how sits on a few

4
00:00:04,919 --> 00:00:06,439
laptops and in a few heads.

5
00:00:06,727 --> 00:00:08,897
Data the company paid for goes unopened.

6
00:00:09,189 --> 00:00:10,649
Our team has seen this firsthand.

7
00:00:11,012 --> 00:00:13,157
Atlassian found that teams lose a quarter

8
00:00:13,157 --> 00:00:15,062
of their time searching for answers.

9
00:00:15,309 --> 00:00:16,839
Kohu is one place to ask.

10
00:00:18,075 --> 00:00:19,276
A new hire asks how to

11
00:00:19,276 --> 00:00:20,855
process a customer refund.

12
00:00:21,135 --> 00:00:22,185
Muse Spark searches only

13
00:00:22,185 --> 00:00:24,235
the sources this role may see,

14
00:00:24,235 --> 00:00:26,835
and every sentence comes back with a citation.

15
00:00:27,117 --> 00:00:28,887
This one opens the written process.

16
00:00:29,153 --> 00:00:30,788
This one plays the screen

17
00:00:30,788 --> 00:00:33,168
recording from the exact second,

18
00:00:33,168 --> 00:00:35,553
and SAM 3.1 marks the field to use.

19
00:00:35,819 --> 00:00:36,829
Kohu built these steps

20
00:00:36,829 --> 00:00:38,649
from the recording itself,

21
00:00:38,649 --> 00:00:40,959
with Muse Voice Transcribe and Muse Spark.

22
00:00:41,375 --> 00:00:42,160
A reason is kept only

23
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,745
when the narrator said it.

24
00:00:44,951 --> 00:00:46,356
Next the new hire asks which

25
00:00:46,356 --> 00:00:48,011
country grew fastest last year.

26
00:00:48,352 --> 00:00:49,827
The answer comes from a report

27
00:00:49,827 --> 00:00:51,672
the company licensed for everyone,

28
00:00:51,672 --> 00:00:53,512
one most people never knew it had.

29
00:00:53,801 --> 00:00:55,201
SAM marks the chart,

30
00:00:55,201 --> 00:00:57,151
and Muse Spark reads the values.

31
00:00:58,316 --> 00:00:59,741
The full dataset behind that

32
00:00:59,741 --> 00:01:01,496
report has only a few seats.

33
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:03,245
Asked by all four roles,

34
00:01:03,245 --> 00:01:05,650
only the analyst gets the exact value,

35
00:01:05,650 --> 00:01:07,300
cited to the row and cell.

36
00:01:07,593 --> 00:01:08,928
The others get nothing from it,

37
00:01:08,928 --> 00:01:10,623
and no hint that it exists.

38
00:01:11,788 --> 00:01:13,288
Here two sources disagree.

39
00:01:13,589 --> 00:01:16,179
The licensed report says Viet Nam

40
00:01:16,179 --> 00:01:18,209
grew five percent in 2023.

41
00:01:18,548 --> 00:01:20,288
An internal slide says six and a half.

42
00:01:20,712 --> 00:01:22,472
Kohu shows both and does not pick.

43
00:01:22,791 --> 00:01:24,161
The data admin decides

44
00:01:24,161 --> 00:01:25,331
that the report is right.

45
00:01:25,616 --> 00:01:27,496
Ask again, and the answer changes.

46
00:01:27,759 --> 00:01:29,499
The slide is marked as superseded.

47
00:01:30,759 --> 00:01:32,729
A manager uploads a new recording.

48
00:01:33,029 --> 00:01:34,189
Kohu transcribes it,

49
00:01:34,189 --> 00:01:35,709
sends the video and the

50
00:01:35,709 --> 00:01:36,919
transcript to Muse Spark,

51
00:01:36,919 --> 00:01:38,699
and gets back timed steps.

52
00:01:38,948 --> 00:01:40,258
The waiting is sped up here.

53
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,985
Each step gets a frame,

54
00:01:41,985 --> 00:01:43,119
a mark from SAM,

55
00:01:43,119 --> 00:01:45,600
and a reason only if one was spoken.

56
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:46,924
A person approves it

57
00:01:46,924 --> 00:01:48,329
before anyone can cite it.

58
00:01:49,519 --> 00:01:51,949
The license card shows who used the paid data.

59
00:01:52,237 --> 00:01:54,257
The baseline is labeled sample data.

60
00:01:55,493 --> 00:01:56,183
We measured it.

61
00:01:56,548 --> 00:01:58,051
Ninety six of one hundred

62
00:01:58,051 --> 00:02:00,133
answers passed over five runs,

63
00:02:00,133 --> 00:02:02,748
with no leaks in seventy four access checks.

64
00:02:03,021 --> 00:02:04,701
The failures are in the repo too.

